      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I am really glad to hear that! I have been trying out various music genres and styles lately. Do you prefer classical, jazz, or electronic music?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:41:06.015292+00:00"
    },
    {
