      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I love a lot of genres but I think classical is my favorite because it's so expressive and emotive.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:45:16.783461+00:00"
    },
